            {
              "id": "3916cb15-17f6-3e0e-b2ae-f1dae0c02441",
              "name": "Spring Endpoint Vulnerability",
              "helpUri": "https://www.glog.ai/",
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "## Description\n\nThe code snippet provided is vulnerable to XML External Entity (XXE) Injection attacks. This vulnerability occurs when an application processes XML data that contains a reference to an external entity. The application can be tricked into disclosing internal files using file URI schemes, internal file shares, or even remote code execution.\n\nIn this case, the application is processing XML data without properly disabling the use of external entities. The `parseXml` method is likely the one that is vulnerable.\n\n## Mitigation Advice\n\nTo mitigate this vulnerability, you should disable the use of external entities in your XML parser. This can be done by configuring your XML parser to not use external DTDs and to not resolve external entities.\n\n## Source Code Fix Recommendation\n\nAssuming that `parseXml` method uses `DocumentBuilderFactory` to parse XML data, you should configure it as follows:\n\n```java\nDocumentBuilderFactory dbf = DocumentBuilderFactory.newInstance();\ndbf.setFeature(\"http://apache.org/xml/features/disallow-doctype-decl\", true);\ndbf.setFeature(\"http://xml.org/sax/features/external-general-entities\", false);\ndbf.setFeature(\"http://xml.org/sax/features/external-parameter-entities\", false);\ndbf.setFeature(\"http://apache.org/xml/features/nonvalidating/load-external-dtd\", false);\ndbf.setXIncludeAware(false);\ndbf.setExpandEntityReferences(false);\n```\n\n## Library Dependencies\n\nThe code snippet provided does not provide enough context to determine the exact library dependencies. However, it is likely that the following libraries are required:\n\n- Spring Framework\n- Spring Security\n- Apache Commons Lang (for `ExceptionUtils`)\n\n## References\n\n- [OWASP XXE Prevention Cheat Sheet](https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/XML_External_Entity_Prevention_Cheat_Sheet.html)\n- [CWE-611: Improper Restriction of XML External Entity Reference ('XXE')](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/611.html)"
              },
              "properties": {
                "cwe": [
                  {
                    "id": "CWE-611",
                    "url": "https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/611.html"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "FAIL",
                "security-severity": "3.0",
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "CWE-611"
                ]
              }
